  "details": "For the last month or so, world information (thumbnail, title, etc) shown in lists both in-game and on the website has been stuck with whatever it was set to when the issue began. For worlds created after the issue started, the information is stuck at whatever it was set to when the world was first uploaded. Information on the world pages themselves is updated properly.\nPictures all show the same world in-game and on the website: 寝転ん温室 GreenHouse Jp by Nekoro (https://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_3cb0aa9f-589e-44fd-9813-5f67e70d5d1f)",
